# docs/design/42-files.md, docs/compiler/codegen.md §16: `Files` resolves to `BrowserFiles` with no
# `use` rule. Its browser body is the files chunk, which only an app whose client injects `Files`
# ships; the entry's container imports it from there. The server has no files: its container's
# `Files` is the stand-in that panics.
